    },
    "This API provider requires Repo Manager Pro. Open Providers to purchase or restore the one-time unlock. ChatGPT connection and Apple Intelligence remain included.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This API provider requires Repo Manager Pro. Open Providers to purchase or restore the one-time unlock. ChatGPT connection and Apple Intelligence remain included."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser API-Anbieter erfordert Repo Manager Pro. Öffne „Anbieter“, um die einmalige Freischaltung zu kaufen oder wiederherzustellen. ChatGPT-Verbindung und Apple Intelligence bleiben enthalten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este proveedor de API requiere Repo Manager Pro. Abre Proveedores para comprar o restaurar el desbloqueo único. La conexión con ChatGPT y Apple Intelligence siguen incluidas."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يتطلب مزود API هذا Repo Manager Pro. افتح المزودين لشراء الفتح لمرة واحدة أو استعادته. يظل اتصال ChatGPT وApple Intelligence مُضمّنين."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu API sağlayıcısı Repo Manager Pro gerektirir. Tek seferlik kilidi satın almak veya geri yüklemek için Sağlayıcılar’ı aç. ChatGPT bağlantısı ve Apple Intelligence dahil kalır."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このAPIプロバイダにはRepo Manager Proが必要です。「プロバイダ」で買い切り機能の購入または復元を行ってください。ChatGPT接続とApple Intelligenceは引き続き含まれます。"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "इस API प्रदाता के लिए Repo Manager Pro चाहिए। एक बार का अनलॉक खरीदने या बहाल करने के लिए प्रदाता खोलें। ChatGPT कनेक्शन और Apple Intelligence शामिल रहते हैं।"
          }
